<title>FINLAND: FINNISH COOPERATIVE BANKS' 9-MONTH PROFIT SURGES.</title>
<headline>FINNISH COOPERATIVE BANKS' 9-MONTH PROFIT SURGES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to end-Sept, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit after credit losses	 669 vs 40</p>
<p> Loan and guarantee losses		    1,345 vs 1,724</p>
<p> Net income from financial operations     3,018 vs 3,280</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the Finnish banking group is</p>
<p>Osuuspankkiryhma.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0242</p>
</text>
